    Bug 1989490 - Remove dimension testing from browser_ext_windows.js and fix expected window state on Wayland. r=mkmelin

    The dimensions are already tested elsewhere (that other test will be moved
    into it own test file and extended to cover popups, if that is not already
    tested there). The failing test can be removed from this test file.

    The patch also updates the expexted state values on Wayland system, which
    fixes fails when run localy on a Wayland system (CI is currently not using
    Wayland).

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D274278

